          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.006990104242983942,
          "sentence": "Philosophers and scientists have tried for hundreds of years to delimit the entities we refer to when we use them, without reaching a definitive agreement.",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
            "human": 0.993009895757016,
            "ai": 0.0004938398342989806,
            "paraphrased": 0.006496264408684961
          },
          "interpretability_value": null,
          "interpretability_normalized_value": null,
          "interpretability_designation": null,
          "interpretability_alpha": null,
          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.007304161191772684,
          "sentence": "For that reason, one of the most obvious and natural questions when we become interested in this science is also one of the most difficult to answer: “What does psychology study?” In this learning project we will try to answer that question.",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
            "human": 0.9926958388082273,
            "ai": 0.0005210870992793427,
            "paraphrased": 0.006783074092493341
          },
          "interpretability_value": null,
          "interpretability_normalized_value": null,
          "interpretability_designation": null,
          "interpretability_alpha": null,
          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.006970280086966035,
          "sentence": "We will not do so by proposing a definition, but by taking a high-level tour through this field of study.",
          "perplexity": 0,
          "class_probabilities": {
            "human": 0.993029719913034,
            "ai": 0.00047815323684502156,
            "paraphrased": 0.0064921268501210135
          },
          "interpretability_value": null,
          "interpretability_normalized_value": null,
          "interpretability_designation": null,
          "interpretability_alpha": null,
          "highlight_sentence_for_ai": false,
          "special_highlight_type": null
        },
        {
          "generated_prob": 0.007293246582562797,
          "sentence": "In this way we hope to give a general idea of its scope and to familiarize the reader with the basic concepts needed to go deeper into other topics of interest related to the “human mind.”",
